      "title": "Nothing Comes Easy",
      "kit": "Light blue & black",
      "bio": "Stacey have one league title and a reputation nobody relishes testing. They close gaps early, hold their shape and refuse to be drawn out. Even Angels know how quickly a promising attack can turn into another pass sideways. Against Stacey, getting near the box is one thing. Getting a clean shot away is another.",
