    "CityMen": {
      "title": "The Show Starts Here",
      "kit": "Crimson & white",
      "bio": "CityMen have the kind of lineup that makes you check the team sheet twice. There’s star quality everywhere, and nobody’s shy about showing it. A first touch can get as big a reaction as a goal. The question is what happens when all that individual talent clicks at once. That’s the CityMen performance everyone wants to see.",
