    "Infinity": {
      "title": "Never a Quiet Game",
      "kit": "Deep blue & cyan",
      "bio": "Infinity are the league’s lovable little brothers, right up until they make a big brother look silly. Their games can get messy, and that’s often when they’re most dangerous. A loose ball, a run nobody tracked, a move that looked dead two seconds ago. Somehow, Infinity turn it into the moment everyone talks about afterwards.",
