    "Angels": {
      "title": "The Standard Everyone Chases",
      "kit": "White & silver",
      "bio": "The most decorated club in the league has made winning look routine. It isn’t. Angels bring elite talent and composed football, but the real test comes when you think you’ve got them beat. They can look out of a game for long stretches and still find the one opening that changes it. Every contender wants the title. They all want to beat Angels on the way there.",
      "image": "/assets/club-Angels.webp",
