    "Foxes": {
      "title": "The Wild Card With Two Titles",
      "kit": "Orange & black",
      "bio": "Two titles tell you the Foxes are more than a surprise package. What makes them hard to prepare for is how often a new face changes the way they play. There’s always someone willing to try a run or a pass that wasn’t in the scouting report. By the time you’ve worked out what the Foxes are doing, they’re usually doing something else.",
