    "Darkfang": {
      "title": "The Bite Is Coming Back",
      "kit": "Black & gold",
      "bio": "Darkfang are rediscovering what made them such a difficult team to play. They stay compact, choose their moments and don’t chase a game just because the opposition wants them to. Give them a loose pass, though, and that patience can turn into a counter before you’ve had time to get back. The bite is coming back.",
