    "Typhoon": {
      "title": "No Time to Breathe",
      "kit": "Green",
      "bio": "Typhoon play like the next five seconds matter more than the last ninety. Young, quick and relentless, they press one pass and are already moving to close down the next. Their energy can make a match unpredictable, including for them. But once they find their rhythm, even a simple pass back starts to feel risky.",
